  - question: "Will my debt actually expire if I stay in CNC?"
    answer: "Potentially, yes. If the 10-year collection statute expires while you're in CNC, the IRS can no longer legally collect. However, certain actions (like filing for bankruptcy or leaving the country) can pause the statute."
  - question: "What if the IRS removes my CNC status?"
